Ctrl+S       -> Ctrl+S       mods 4  bytes: ^S 
ctrl-alt-up  -> Ctrl+Alt+Up  mods 6  bytes: ESC [ 1 ; 7 A 
Shift+Tab    -> Shift+Tab    mods 1  bytes: ESC [ Z 
F10          -> F10          mods 0  bytes: ESC [ 2 1 ~ 
Alt+Enter    -> Alt+Enter    mods 2  bytes: ESC ^M 
Hyper+Q      not a key
Alt+Shift+F matches: 1, Alt+F matches: 0
